# Constantin Kogan on X: "🚀 OpenAI just pushed the AI frontier higher with GPT-6 Astra. According to Epoch AI, Astra reached an estimated 169 on the Epoch Capabilities Index, the highest score measured so far and slightly ahead of the current reasoning-era trend. 📈 Frontier model capability has been improving at roughly 15 ECI points per year, and the pace still isn’t showing much sign of slowing. The bigger implication: the competitive advantage in AI is shifting away from simply having access to the best model. As intelligence gets cheaper and more capable, data, distribution, infrastructure and proprietary workflows become far more important."

